e launches a worldwide assault and Duke carries his one-man crusade across iconic cities and landmarks around the planet.", "summary": "Frag like it\u2019s 1996 \u2013 this time with even more asses to kick! Join the world\u2019s greatest action hero in Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary World Tour as he saves Earth once again, kicking alien ass and saving babes across the globe along the way.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/duke-nukem-3d-20th-anniversary-world-tour", "videos": [{"id": 10283, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "SvVmSJKMktc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SvVmSJKMktc", "title": "Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary World Tour Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SvVmSJKMktc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 10284, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "13bleoM_EfE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=13bleoM_EfE", "title": "Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary World Tour Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/13bleoM_EfE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 9792, "name": "Presidential Trailer", "video_id": "v43dl46UHK4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v43dl46UHK4", "title": "Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary Edition World Tour - Presidential Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/v43dl46UHK4/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 64, "name": "Duke Nukem"}]}